cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this architecture, please cite the book and this repository."
title: "Dementia Digital Twin Engine (DTE) Reference Architecture"
abstract: >-
  An open reference architecture for integrating AI Digital Twins and Brain-Computer
  Interfaces into the dementia care pathway, comprising a Digital Twin Engine, a Memory
  Anchoring Pipeline, FHIR R5 data schemas, and a runnable reference implementation on
  synthetic data. Companion to the DBA dissertation book by Kishan Das. Contains no real
  patient data; all quantitative examples are illustrative.
type: software
authors:
